- Warn moved out of `_parse_draft` (which parses twice per cache hit — validation in `content_draft_agent.py:158` + real parse at `:118` — and N times under retry) into `_warn_if_notes_missing` at `content_draft_agent.py:137`, at method level after the cache if/else: fires exactly once per `draft_slide` call on both hit and miss paths.
